  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>需要：</strong></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Mandala's GUI - 深色模式</span></span></strong></a></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SZtKgXnvWM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1206958586455130142?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fgammael_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/url?url=https://x.com/gammael_&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=X&amp;label=@Gammael_&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"X (原名 Twitter) 網址\"></a></p><p>非官方自訂 Mandala's GUI - 深色模式模組相容性資源包。為我喜歡使用的模組提供相容性支援。（仍在開發中）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>此資源包適用於 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Fabric</span> 和 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Forge</span> 版本。&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mandalas-gui-dark-mode-mod/comments\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">您可以在評論區提出模組請求</span></span></strong></a></p><h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>NeoForge 版本：<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mandalas-gui-dark-mode-neo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此查看</a></span></strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>相容模組：</strong></span></h3><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>ACCESSORIES（配件）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>AETHER（天域）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>AETHER PROTECT YOUR MOA（天域：保護你的渡鴉）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>APOTHIC ATTRIBUTES（神化屬性）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>ATTRIBUTES LIB（屬性庫）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>BACKPACKED（背包系統）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>BARTERING STATION（以物易物站）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>BETTER END（終界改良）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>BLUE SKIES（蔚藍蒼穹）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>BOSS TITLES（頭銜稱號）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>CORPSE（屍體）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>COSMETIC ARMOR REWORKED（裝飾盔甲重製版）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>CURIOS（飾品）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>DAILY SHOP（每日商店）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>EMI（物品管理器）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>FARMER'S DELIGHT（農夫樂事）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>INMIS（物品管理）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>INVENTORY MANAGEMENT（背包管理）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>INVENTORY TWEAKS REFOXED（背包優化重製版）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>IRON FURNACES（鐵製熔爐）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>MYTHIC CHARMS（神話護符）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>POLYMORPH（多型）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>SAWMILL（鋸木廠）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>SKY GUIS（天空介面）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>SOPHISTICATED CORE（精密核心）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>SUPPLEMENTARIES (TRINKETS)（補充品-飾品）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>TOM'S SIMPLE STORAGE（湯姆簡易儲物）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>TOM'S TRADING NETWORK（湯姆交易網絡）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>TRASH SLOT（垃圾桶欄位）</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>TRINKETS（飾品）</strong></span></li>\n</ul><h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">正在為您的模組包尋找自訂 GUI 資源包嗎？請在</span> <strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/SZtKgXnvWM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span></strong> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">聯繫我，討論如何協助您實現願景！</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fGammael\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">如果能力允許，歡迎在 ko-fi 上贊助。</a></span></p>",
